{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030111637808-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030122243\"/><p>男工被送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p>上水發生工業意外。今晨(30日)10時50分，清曉路一地盤職員報案，指一名男工在上址工作期間，遭鐵枝插傷下顎。救援人員接報到場，將受傷清醒男工連同鐵枝送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，案件列作「工業意外-有人受傷」跟進，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:46.355578+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:16:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:46.743667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:46.743667+00:00","content_hash":"e957f0ce2b4b302c6802681b0c01efaba324ab661601f62370bdf3ef8c10e474","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}